                  "columnGap": "20"
                }
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "s3t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Bob was well known in and around the rural Southwest Wisconsin community, having lived in the region his entire 35 years. A decade earlier, he drove his own milk route, collecting Grade B milk from the region’s abundant dairy farms for delivery to Brewery Hill Cheese factory. He used to be a cheese-maker, before becoming a long-distance trucker. He later co-owned Mc-Mor-Han Trucking Company, which had been hauling livestock and fertilizer for eight years, and had been selling GMC pick-up trucks since 1958.",
                    "width": "full"
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "paddingTop": 0,
                      "paddingBottom": 0
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "s3t4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "More than 60 years after Shullsburg, the McCoy Group has grown into a corporation with five subsidiaries that reaches across North America.",
                    "width": "full"
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "paddingTop": 0,
                      "paddingBottom": 0
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "s3t5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Currently, the McCoy Group consists of Truck Country/Stoops Freightliner-Western Star, Foodliner, Quest Liner, Foodliner Mexico/Quest Liner Mexico and McCoy Construction & Forestry, employing more than 3,600 people.",
                    "width": "full"
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "paddingTop": 0,
                      "paddingBottom": 0
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
